### Phase 4: Ensure Idempotency

**Step 1: Implement Idempotency Key Generation**

```csharp
public class IdempotencyKeyGenerator
{
    /// <summary>
    /// Generates idempotency key for claim submission
    /// Format: {EntityId}:{UserId}:{Date}:{HashOfContent}
    /// </summary>
    public static string GenerateKey(Guid claimId, Guid userId, Claim claim)
    {
        var contentHash = ComputeContentHash(claim);
        return $"claim:{claimId}:{userId}:{DateTime.UtcNow:yyyyMMdd}:{contentHash}";
    }

    private static string ComputeContentHash(Claim claim)
    {
        var json = JsonSerializer.Serialize(claim, new JsonSerializerOptions
        {
            DefaultIgnoreCondition = JsonIgnoreCondition.WhenWritingNull,
            WriteIndented = false
        });

        using var sha256 = SHA256.Create();
        var hashBytes = sha256.ComputeHash(Encoding.UTF8.GetBytes(json));
        return Convert.ToBase64String(hashBytes).Substring(0, 16);
    }
}
```

